Package: maxentgpu
Title: Maximum-Entropy Presence-Background Models with Torch
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Taimur", "Khan", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "taimur.khan@ufz.de")
  )
Description: A research-software implementation of auditable maximum-entropy
    presence-background models using 'torch' for tensor computation. Backend
    diagnostics are available now, with model fitting and prediction capabilities
    under active development.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/thisistaimur/maxentgpu,
    https://thisistaimur.github.io/maxentgpu/
BugReports: https://github.com/thisistaimur/maxentgpu/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Depends:
    R (>= 4.3.0)
Suggests:
    maxnet (== 0.1.4),
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    torch (>= 0.17.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/Needs/website: pkgdown
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
